---- MODULE RandomSampling ----
EXTENDS Integers, TLC, Randomization
VARIABLE x
Init == x = 0
Next == UNCHANGED x
Interval(unused) == RandomElement(-1000000..1000000)
Enumeration(unused) == RandomElement({9, 1, 5, 1})
Product(unused) == RandomElement((1..4000) \X (1..4000) \X (1..4000))
Functions(unused) == RandomElement([{3, 1, 2} -> 1..1000000])
Records(unused) == RandomElement([z: 1..1000000, a: {2, 1}, m: 1..1000000])
